2. Package Dependencies (CRITICAL)

package.json

{
  "name": "@acme/ui",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "sideEffects": ["dist/styles.css"],
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "import": "./dist/index.js",
      "require": "./dist/index.cjs",
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts"
    },
    "./styles.css": "./dist/styles.css"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^19.2.3",
    "react-dom": "^19.2.3"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@measured/puck": "^0.x",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.0.0"
  }
}

Why sideEffects?

So bundlers don’t tree-shake your CSS away.

⸻

