4. Build Tailwind Into CSS (MANDATORY)

Add build script

{
  "scripts": {
    "build:css": "tailwindcss -i src/styles/tailwind.css -o dist/styles.css --minify",
    "build:ts": "tsup",
    "build": "pnpm build:css && pnpm build:ts"
  }
}

This produces a fully compiled CSS file.

